 나가면 그는 지원 분대에 끼어, 뜯어진 정비 틈의 단추 덮개를 그 자리에서 꿰매어 잇는 일을 맡는다. 군대가 나가지 않는 날에는 삼성 정비대의 연장을 갈며, 날 하나를 두고 반나절을 쓴다.","관직":"직함 야전 정비공. 직위 야전 정비공 · 삼성역. 품계 정비공. 일하는 역 삼성역."},"values":{"권위":25,"개방":0,"무력":-15,"물질":-40,"공동":45,"원칙":10,"공개":-70,"자격":5,"분산":-15,"변혁":45},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":-30,"위험":15,"과시":10,"지속":-10,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0112","role":"single","personFaith":"baptised","houseFaith":"baptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"fitted","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0113', 'c5c4-c601-c6d4', '{"id":"person-0113","name":"Eom Mi-rae","title":"Bench fitter","position":"Bench fitter · Jamsil Station","characterId":"K112","rank":"Fitter","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Implant maintenance","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0113","birthDate":"2078-08-21","birthday":"08-21","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"c5c4-c601-c6d4","name":"Yeongwol Eom Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c5c4-c601-c6d4.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"Eom Mi-rae is a bench fitter at the bench of the Hierophant''s household. That bench is held by the Hierophant directly, not by the Songpa Near House, so although she lives at Jamsil her name is not on the Songpa queue. She has two parts and keeps her sleeves tied up to the elbow. To anyone who asks what she is mending, she answers only, \"Let''s mend it and use it.\"","fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Title":"Bench fitter","Rank":"Fitter","Livelihood":"Implant maintenance","Work Station":"Jamsil Station","Home Station":"Jamsil Station","Household":"Single household","Part Count":2},"sections":{"Life":"Eom Mi-rae is a bench fitter at the bench of the Hierophant''s household. That bench is held by the Hierophant directly, not by the Songpa Near House, so although she lives at Jamsil her name is not on the Songpa queue. She has two parts and keeps her sleeves tied up to the elbow. To anyone who asks what she is mending, she answers only, \"Let''s mend it and use it.\"","Offices":"Title Bench fitter. Position Bench fitter · Jamsil Station. Rank Fitter. Work station Jamsil Station."},"values":{"Authority":25,"Openness":0,"Force":0,"Material":-30,"Communal":45,"Principle":-5,"Public":-40,"Eligibility":-15,"Dispersed":-15,"Transformative":50},"desire":{"Longing":50,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-15,"Display":-25