못한다.","relationship":"사령관과는 장부를 사이에 두고만 말한다.","effects":[]}],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0175', NULL, '{"id":"person-0175","name":"Clara Bennett","title":"Commissioner of the Korea Forest Service","position":"Commissioner of the Korea Forest Service · Gwanghwamun Station","characterId":"K174","rank":"Commissioner","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Ministry administration","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","detailRoute":"/people/person-0175","birthDate":"2096-08-08","birthday":"08-08","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":null,"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"Under the nameplate of the Forest Service commissioner''s office at the Government Complex Seoul is Commissioner Clara Bennett''s entry: Gwanghwamun Station, Sajik-dong, Jongno-gu, and the age thirty. She sets the felling permits on Bukhansan and Dobongsan and each district''s firewood share, and every year before the long-dark half she sends the firewood-share notice to the Members for Eunpyeong and Dobong on the same day at the same hour. She holds that getting the order of funerals and ceremonies right is her own task, so on the days the felling crews go out to the mountains she draws up the sledge order herself and attaches it to the notice. If the Bukhansan firewood contract with Assembly Member Jo Ha-rin is even a day late, the Eunpyeong side argues as loudly as at a strike-off hearing.","fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Title":"Commissioner of the Korea Forest Service","Rank":"Commissioner","Livelihood":"Ministry administration","Work Station":"Gwanghwamun Station","Home Station":"Gwanghwamun Station","Household":"Single household"},"sections":{"Life":"Under the nameplate of the Forest Service commissioner''s office at the Government Complex Seoul is Commissioner Clara Bennett''s entry: Gwanghwamun Station, Sajik-dong, Jongno-gu, and the age thirty. She sets the felling permits on Bukhansan and Dobongsan and each district''s firewood share, and every year before the long-dark half she sends the firewood-share notice to the Members for Eunpyeong and Dobong on the same day at the same hour. She holds that getting the order of funerals and ceremonies right is her own task, so on the days the felling crews go out to the mountains she draws up the sledge order herself and attaches it to the notice. If the Bukhansan firewood contract with Assembly Member Jo Ha-rin is even a day late, the Eunpyeong side argues as loudly as at a strike-off hearing.","Offices":"Title Commissioner of the Korea Forest Service. Position Commissioner of the Korea Forest Service · Gwanghwamun Station. Rank Commissioner. Work station Gwanghwamun Station."},"values":{"Authority":45,"Openness":-30,"Force":20,"Material":10,"Communal":-5,"Principle":10,"Public":-45,"Eligibility":50,"Dispersed":-45,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":30,"Display":-20,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0175","role":"single","personFaith":"none","houseFaith":"none","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Clara Bennett","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Directly under President for Life Yun Seo-rin"},{"from":"Clara Bennett","type":"Contract","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"Holds a contract that sets the Eunpyeong-gu Bukhansan firewood share each year by Forest Service notice."}],"incoming":[{"from":"Jo Ha-rin","type":"Contract","to":"Clara Bennett","basis":"An agreement that Eunpyeong''s firewood share is not cut when felling permits run late in a blizzard spell"}]},"directLiege":{"personId":"K144","name":"Yun Seo-rin","courtId":"court:K144","effectiveYear":2126,"ownerTerm":"Direct liege","relationKind":"direct-liege"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"s17-0175-rites","name":"Funeral order","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"t17-0175-sledge","name":"The sledge order","description":"Holds that getting the order of funerals and ceremonies right is her own task.","behavior":"On burial days she goes out ahead of the burial crew to look at the route.","stress":"After a ceremony done out of order she is silent for days.","relationship":"Stays loyal to the one she swore to, to the end.","effects":[]}],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}', '{"id":"person-0175","name":"클라라 베넷","title":"산림청장","position":"산림청장 · 광화문역","characterId":"K174","rank":"청장","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"부처 행정","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","detailRoute":"/people/person-0175","birthDate":"2096-08-08","birthday":"08-08","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":null,"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"정부서울청사 산림청장실의 명패 아래에는 청장 클라라 베넷의 기재, 곧 종로구 사직동 광화문역과 서른 살이 적혀 있다. 북한산과 도봉산의 벌목 허가와 구마다의 땔감 몫을 정하고, 해마다 긴 어둠의 반년이 오기 전에 은평과 도봉의 국회의원에게 땔감 몫 고시를 같은 날 같은 시각에 보낸다. 장례와 의례의 순서를 틀리지 않는 것을 제 일로 아는 사람이라, 벌목조가 산으로 나가는 날에는 썰매 순서표를 손수 짜서 고시에 붙인다. 조하린 의원과 맺은 북한산 땔감 계약은 하루라도 늦으면 은평 쪽에서 말소 심의만큼 시끄럽게 따진다.","fields":{"소속":"정부","직함":"산림청장","품계":"청장","생업":"부처 행정","일하는 역":"광화문역","잠자는 역":"광화문역","가구":"혼자 사는 가구"},"sections":{"생애":"정부서울청사 산림청장실의 명패 아래에는 청장 클라라 베넷의 기재, 곧 종로구 사직동 광화문역과 서른 살이 적혀 있다. 북한산과 도봉산의 벌목 허가와 구마다의 땔감 몫을 정하고, 해마다 긴 어둠의 반년이 오기 전에 은평과 도봉의 국회의원에게 땔감 몫 고시를 같은 날 같은 시각에 보낸다. 장례와 의례의 순서를 틀리지 않는 것을 제 일로 아는 사람이라, 벌목조가 산으로 나가는 날에는 썰매 순서표를 손수 짜서 고시에 붙인다. 조하린 의원과 맺은 북한산 땔감 계약은 하루라도 늦으면 은평 쪽에서 말소 심의만큼 시끄럽게 따진다.","관직":"직함 산림청장. 직위 산림청장 · 광화문역. 품계 청장. 일하는 역 광화문역."},"values":{"권위":45,"개방":-30,"무력":20,"물질":10,"공동":-5,"원칙":10,"공개":-45,"자격":50,"분산":-45,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-30,"위험":30,"과시":-20,"지속":20,"지향":"무성향","결합":"비독점"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0175","role":"single","personFaith":"none","houseFaith":"none","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"클라라 베넷","type":"지휘","to":"윤서린","basis":"종신 대통령 윤서린의 직속"},{"from":"클라라 베넷","type":"계약","to":"조하린","basis":"은평구 북한산 땔감 몫을 해마다 산림청 고시로 정하는 계약을 맺고 있다."}],"incoming":[{"from":"조하린","type":"계약","to":"클라라 베넷","basis":"눈보라 철에 벌목 허가가 늦어져도 은평의 땔감 몫을 깎지 않는다는 약정"}]},"directLiege":{"personId":"K144","name":"윤서린","courtId":"court:K144","effectiveYear":2126,"ownerTerm":"직속 주군","relationKind":"direct-liege"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"s17-0175-rites","name":"장례 순서","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"t17-0175-sledge","name":"썰매 순서","description":"장례와 의례의 순서를 틀리지 않는 것을 자기 일로 안다.","behavior":"묘역에 가는 날에는 장례조보다 먼저 나가 길을 본다.","stress":"순서가 어그러진 의례 뒤에는 며칠 말이 없다.","relationship":"맹세한 사람에게 끝까지 충실하다.","effects":[]}],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
