 조장으로, 교대마다 강물의 탁도와 펌프의 소리를 일지에 적는다. 잠실수중보 북쪽 끝의 수차와 같은 강물을 나눠 쓰기 때문에, 보 쪽 수차가 멈추면 그의 펌프조가 가장 먼저 안다. 그는 이 일을 누구에게 배웠느냐는 물음에 펌프가 가르쳤다고만 답한다.","관직":"직함 기능조 조장. 직위 기능조 조장 · 구의역. 품계 등재민. 일하는 역 구의역."},"values":{"권위":45,"개방":-20,"무력":15,"물질":55,"공동":-5,"원칙":-20,"공개":0,"자격":20,"분산":-35,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-30,"위험":-40,"과시":0,"지속":-15,"지향":"이성","결합":"없음"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0218","role":"single","personFaith":"none","houseFaith":"none","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0219', 'c5b4-d568-c885', '{"id":"person-0219","name":"Eo Do-yun","title":"Squad Leader","position":"Squad Leader · Changsin Station","characterId":"K218","rank":"Sergeant First Class","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Levy infantry","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","detailRoute":"/people/person-0219","birthDate":"2096-06-20","birthday":"06-20","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"c5b4-d568-c885","name":"Eo Clan of Hamjong","crest":"clan-crests/c5b4-d568-c885.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"In the watch-post relief list her line reads: Changsin Station, Bomun-dong, Seongbuk-gu; army household; Sergeant First Class. A squad leader of the Seongbuk-gu district unit, she holds the entrances of Changsin on Line 6 and the tunnel toward Bomun. When she leads a squad out to relieve the watch posts toward Bukhansan, she lifts each soldier''s boot sole to look at it before she opens the entrance. On days she comes down from the posts she stops at the school on the old university grounds and teaches the children the sirens one by one.","fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Title":"Squad Leader","Rank":"Sergeant First Class","Livelihood":"Levy infantry","Work Station":"Changsin Station","Home Station":"Changsin Station","Household":"Single household"},"sections":{"Life":"In the watch-post relief list her line reads: Changsin Station, Bomun-dong, Seongbuk-gu; army household; Sergeant First Class. A squad leader of the Seongbuk-gu district unit, she holds the entrances of Changsin on Line 6 and the tunnel toward Bomun. When she leads a squad out to relieve the watch posts toward Bukhansan, she lifts each soldier''s boot sole to look at it before she opens the entrance. On days she comes down from the posts she stops at the school on the old university grounds and teaches the children the sirens one by one.","Offices":"Title Squad Leader. Position Squad Leader · Changsin Station. Rank Sergeant First Class. Work station Changsin Station."},"values":{"Authority":55,"Openness":-15,"Force":20,"Material":45,"Communal":-20,"Principle":-5,"Public":5,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":-35,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":-15,"Display":-30,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0219","role":"single","personFaith":"none","houseFaith":"none","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":4,"effective":4},"intrigue":{"base":5,"effective":5},"learning":{"base":4,"effective":4},"prowess":{"base":11,"effective":11}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}', '{"id":"person-0219","name":"어도윤","title":"분대장","position":"분대장 · 창신역","characterId":"K218","rank":"중사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"징집 보병","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","detailRoute":"/people/person-0219","birthDate":"2096-06-20","birthday":"06-20","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"c5b4-d568-c885","name":"함종 어씨","crest":"clan-crests/c5b4-d568-c885.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"망대 교대 명단에서 그녀의 줄은 성북구 보문동 창신역, 군 가구, 중사다. 성북구 부대의 분대장으로, 6호선 창신역 출입구와 보문 쪽 터널을 지킨다. 북한산 쪽 망대로 교대 나가는 분대를 이끌 때면 그녀는 병사들의 장화 밑창을 하나씩 들춰 보고서야 출입구를 연다. 망대에서 내려온 날에는 옛 대학 터 학교에 들러 아이들에게 사이렌 소리를 하나씩 가르친다.","fields":{"소속":"정부","직함":"분대장","품계":"중사","생업":"징집 보병","일하는 역":"창신역","잠자는 역":"창신역","가구":"혼자 사는 가구"},"sections":{"생애":"망대 교대 명단에서 그녀의 줄은 성북구 보문동 창신역, 군 가구, 중사다. 성북구 부대의 분대장으로, 6호선 창신역 출입구와 보문 쪽 터널을 지킨다. 북한산 쪽 망대로 교대 나가는 분대를 이끌 때면 그녀는 병사들의 장화 밑창을 하나씩 들춰 보고서야 출입구를 연다. 망대에서 내려온 날에는 옛 대학 터 학교에 들러 아이들에게 사이렌 소리를 하나씩 가르친다.","관직":"직함 분대장. 직위 분대장 · 창신역. 품계 중사. 일하는 역 창신역."},"values":{"권위":55,"개방":-15,"무력":20,"물질":45,"공동":-20,"원칙":-5,"공개":5,"자격":15,"분산":-35,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":35,"위험":-15,"과시":-30,"지속":-15,"지향":"무성향","결합":"비독점"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0219","role":"single","personFaith":"none","houseFaith":"none","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":4,"effective":4},"intrigue":{"base":5,"effective":5},"learning":{"base":4,"effective":4},"prowess":{"base":11,"effective":11}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0220', 'cd5c-acbd-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0220","name":"Choe Ji-u","title":"Dongjak Ferry Keeper","position":"Dongjak Ferry Keeper · The Free Cities","characterId":"K219","rank":"Ferry Keeper","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"City governance","gender":"Male","stage":"Key","state":"free-city","stateName":"The Free Cities","detailRoute":"/people/person-0220","birthDate":"2099-01-28","birthday":"01-28","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"cd5c-acbd-c8fc","name":"Gyeongju Choe Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cd5c-acbd-c8fc.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"Choe Ji-u is master of the seal house that holds the Noryangjin crossing; in 2124, the year the previous Ferry Keeper died, he stood before the Noryangjin masters'' meeting on his name-worth at twenty-five and became Dongjak Ferry Keeper. What filled out a name-worth so light in years was the count of sheets of goods he had escorted across without loss, the most of the five crossing chiefs, and he is Ferry Keeper only for as long as he holds the Noryangjin crossing. The twenty-seven-year-old keeps in one ledger the passage share taken from the goods and people at every crossing, noting even whether a share came in watts or in litres. In the winter of 2126, ahead of the third water contract, the Arc delegation must pass from Gubanpo through Dongjak to Yeouido, so he has signed a contract with the host, Yeongdeungpo Market Master Han Jae-mok, over passage and escort on that road. Across the land border he stands against Jeong Yura, Head of the Seocho Near House, over how many watch hands each crossing may post.","fields":{"Affiliation":"The Free Cities","Title":"Dongjak Ferry Keeper","Rank":"Ferry Keeper","Livelihood":"City governance","Work Station":"Noryangjin Station","Home Station":"Noryangjin Station","Household":"Single household"},"sections":{"Life":"Choe Ji-u is master of the seal house that holds the Noryangjin crossing; in 2124, the year the previous Ferry Keeper died, he stood before the Noryangjin masters'' meeting on his name-worth at twenty-five and became Dongjak Ferry Keeper. What filled out a name-worth so light in years was the count of sheets of goods he had escorted across without loss, the most of the five crossing chiefs, and he is Ferry Keeper only for as long as he holds the Noryangjin crossing. The twenty-seven-year-old keeps in one ledger the passage share taken from the goods and people at every crossing, noting even whether a share came in watts or in litres. In the winter of 2126, ahead of the third water contract, the Arc delegation must pass from Gubanpo through Dongjak to Yeouido, so he has signed a contract with the host, Yeongdeungpo Market Master Han Jae-mok, over passage and escort on that road. Across the land border he stands against Jeong Yura, Head of the Seocho Near House, over how many watch hands each crossing may post.","Offices":"Title Dongjak Ferry Keeper. Position Dongjak Ferry Keeper · The Free Cities. Rank Ferry Keeper. Work station Noryangjin Station."},"values":{"Authority":-55,"Openness":25,"Force":-50,"Material":5,"Communal":-45,"Principle":20,"Public":70,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":85,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-20,"Display":-10,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0220","role":"single","personFaith":"none","houseFaith":"none","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Choe Ji-u","type":"Contract","to":"Han Jae-mok","basis":"A contract to give passage and escort through the Dongjak crossings to the Arc delegation coming to the third water contract meeting, for a share"},{"from":"Choe Ji-u","type":"Rivalry","to":"Jeong Yura","basis":"They stand against each other over how many watch hands each side may post at the three land crossings on the Dongjak–Seocho border"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gu Taeyun","type":"Command","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Directly under Dongjak Ferry Keeper Choe Ji-u"},{"from":"Bak Soeon","type":"Command","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Directly under Dongjak Ferry Keeper Choe Ji-u"},{"from":"Chae Riul","type":"Command","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Directly under Dongjak Ferry Keeper Choe Ji-u"},{"from":"Je Haon","type":"Command","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Directly under Dongjak Ferry Keeper Choe Ji-u"},{"from":"Je Munseok","type":"Command","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Directly under Dongjak Ferry Keeper Choe Ji-u"},{"from":"Gi Pilho","type":"Command","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Directly under Dongjak Ferry Keeper Choe Ji-u"},{"from":"Hwang Eunseol","type":"Command","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Directly under Dongjak Ferry Keeper Choe Ji-u"},{"from":"Jo Eunu","type":"Command","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Directly under Dongjak Ferry Keeper Choe Ji-u"},{"from":"Yong Bok","type":"Command","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Directly under Dongjak Ferry Keeper Choe Ji-u"},{"from":"Bok Dumo","type":"Command","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Directly under Dongjak Ferry Keeper Choe Ji-u"},{"from":"Min Kahyeon","type":"Command","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Directly under Dongjak Ferry Keeper Choe Ji-u"},{"from":"Jo Jaepyo","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Pays the Dongjak Ferry Keeper a crossing share in return for staying at Dongjak Station"},{"from":"Bak Soeon","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"On the day they made the sheet, wrote on its last line that she and Choe Ji-u would speak to each other as equals"},{"from":"Hwang Eunseol","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Supplies fish to the riverside crossing watches; in return the watch guards the ice holes off Nodeul"},{"from":"Jo Eunu","type":"Oath","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"At the meeting that settled the Ferry Keeper she sealed that the count of his name-worth was right, and swore not to dispute it while he holds the Noryangjin crossing"},{"from":"Jeong Hojun","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"A promise with the Dongjak Ferry Keeper that he takes the machined parts Dongjak technicians bring to the Express Bus Terminal exchange and gives out machine-body maintenance turns in return"},{"from":"Jang Minjae","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"A promise with the Dongjak Ferry Keeper to set the dates and numbers of divided-family members who cross the Sadang–Bangbae border"},{"from":"Gwon Do-ha","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"A promise with the Dongjak Ferry Keeper to repay the wire and cells coming into the Express Bus Terminal parts exchange with agreed maintenance turns"},{"from":"Jeong Yura","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Settles the shares of the border crossing in numbers every day with Choe Ji-u, the Dongjak Ferry Keeper"}]},"court":{"id":"court:K219","members":[{"personId":"K011","name":"Gu Taeyun"},{"personId":"K033","name":"Bak Soeon"},{"personId":"K041","name":"Chae Riul"},{"personId":"K044","name":"Je Haon"},{"personId":"K048","name":"Je Munseok"},{"personId":"K056","name":"Gi Pilho"},{"personId":"K221","name":"Hwang Eunseol"},{"personId":"K224","name":"Jo Eunu"},{"personId":"person-0229","name":"Yong Bok"},{"personId":"person-0231","name":"Bok Dumo"},{"personId":"person-0816","name":"Min Kahyeon"}]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"t18-0220-passage-ledger","name":"Passage-share ledger","rating":72},{"id":"t18-0220-crossing-watch","name":"Posting crossing watches","rating":58}],"traits":[{"id":"t18-0220-holds-the-crossing","name":"Hand on the crossing","description":"Never forgets that losing his crossing means losing his seat.","behavior":"Calls the watch changes at the Noryangjin crossing himself and leaves them to no one else.","stress":"When blizzards shut the bridges for days and the passage share stops coming in.","relationship":"Asks the crossing chiefs for figures in plain talk, and says to people from north of the river and from the Arc only what is written in the contract.","effects":[]}],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:v3:duchy:11590","name":{"en":"Dongjak-gu duchy"},"holderPersonId":"K219","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"free-city","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1159051000","name":"Noryangjin 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1159052000","name":"Noryangjin 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1159053000","name":"Sangdo 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1159054000","name":"Sangdo 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1159055000","name":"Sangdo 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1159056000","name":"Sangdo 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1159060500","name":"Heukseok-dong"},{"id":"region:1159062000","name":"Sadang 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1159063000","name":"Sadang 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1159064000","name":"Sadang 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1159065000","name":"Sadang 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1159065100","name":"Sadang 5-dong"},{"id":"region:1159066000","name":"Daebang-dong"},{"id":"region:1159067000","name":"Sindaebang 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1159068000","name":"Sindaebang 2-dong"}],"territorialScale":"duchy","titleId":"geography:duchy:11590","geometrySource":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"subordinateHoldings":[{"id":"holding:v3:section:동작구:상도","name":{"en":"Sangdo section"},"holderPersonId":"K041","directLiegePersonId":"K219","stateId":"free-city","stationRef":{"stationId":"상도","stationName":"Sangdo"},"adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1159053000","name":"Sangdo 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1159054000","name":"Sangdo 2-do