이 맞춤 날을 건너뛰고 셈표에만 도장을 찍은 일이었다. 그 일 뒤로 강남역 사람들은 셈표가 의심스러우면 스물한 살의 그를 찾고, 그는 자기가 본 것만 본 날과 교대를 함께 대어 말한다. 지금은 부위 하나를 지닌 야전 정비공으로, 연장 꾸러미를 메고 강남역에서 경계 출입구로 나간다. 출입구에서 언 부위를 열 때도 그는 연 시각을 먼저 적는다.","관직":"직함 야전 정비공. 직위 야전 정비공 · 강남역. 품계 정비공. 일하는 역 강남역."},"values":{"권위":40,"개방":-25,"무력":5,"물질":-20,"공동":45,"원칙":-10,"공개":-40,"자격":50,"분산":-25,"변혁":15},"desire":{"갈망":35,"독점":10,"위험":-30,"과시":20,"지속":25,"지향":"무성향","결합":"다자"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0290","role":"single","personFaith":"baptised","houseFaith":"baptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"fitted","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0291', 'c5b4-d568-c885', '{"id":"person-0291","name":"Eo Yerin","title":"Field fitter","position":"Field fitter · Gangnam Station","characterId":"K290","rank":"Fitter","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Implant maintenance","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0291","birthDate":"2094-05-06","birthday":"05-06","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"c5b4-d568-c885","name":"Eo Clan of Hamjong","crest":"clan-crests/c5b4-d568-c885.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"On the wall of the Gangnam bench hangs a fragment of a broken joint. It is the piece Eo Yerin pried off and laid before the Bench Keeper even after being told to leave it as it was. When the bench cannot spare anyone, this thirty-two-year-old field fitter shoulders his tool roll, goes to the border entrances or the exchanges, and opens frozen parts on the spot. When he climbs to the surface he pulls doubled cotton sleeves over his own two parts.","fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Title":"Field fitter","Rank":"Fitter","Livelihood":"Implant maintenance","Work Station":"Gangnam Station","Home Station":"Gangnam Station","Household":"Single household","Part Count":2},"sections":{"Life":"On the wall of the Gangnam bench hangs a fragment of a broken joint. It is the piece Eo Yerin pried off and laid before the Bench Keeper even after being told to leave it as it was. When the bench cannot spare anyone, this thirty-two-year-old field fitter shoulders his tool roll, goes to the border entrances or the exchanges, and opens frozen parts on the spot. When he climbs to the surface he pulls doubled cotton sleeves over his own two parts.","Offices":"Title Field fitter. Position Field fitter · Gangnam Station. Rank Fitter. Work station Gangnam Station."},"values":{"Authority":40,"Openness":-30,"Force":5,"Material":-20,"Communal":45,"Principle":5,"Public":-50,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":5,"Display":-10,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Polyamorous"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0291","role":"single","personFaith":"baptised","houseFaith":"baptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"fitted","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}', '{"id":"person-0291","name":"어예린","title":"야전 정비공","position":"야전 정비공 · 강남역","characterId":"K290","rank":"정비공","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"이식 정비","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"아크","detailRoute":"/people/person-0291","birthDate":"2094-05-06","birthday":"05-06","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"c5b4-d568-c885","name":"함종 어씨","crest":"clan-crests/c5b4-d568-c885.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"강남역 정비대 벽에는 깨진 이음매 조각 하나가 걸려 있다. 그대로 두라는 말을 듣고도 어예린이 떼어 와 정비장 앞에 내놓았던 조각이다. 정비대가 사람을 비울 수 없을 때, 서른두 살의 이 야전 정비공은 연장 꾸러미를 메고 경계 출입구나 바꿈터로 찾아가 언 부위를 그 자리에서 연다. 지상으로 오를 때는 자기 두 부위 위에 솜 토시를 겹쳐 끼운다.","fields":{"소속":"아크","직함":"야전 정비공","품계":"정비공","생업":"이식 정비","일하는 역":"강남역","잠자는 역":"강남역","가구":"혼자 사는 가구","부위 수":2},"sections":{"생애":"강남역 정비대 벽에는 깨진 이음매 조각 하나가 걸려 있다. 그대로 두라는 말을 듣고도 어예린이 떼어 와 정비장 앞에 내놓았던 조각이다. 정비대가 사람을 비울 수 없을 때, 서른두 살의 이 야전 정비공은 연장 꾸러미를 메고 경계 출입구나 바꿈터로 찾아가 언 부위를 그 자리에서 연다. 지상으로 오를 때는 자기 두 부위 위에 솜 토시를 겹쳐 끼운다.","관직":"직함 야전 정비공. 직위 야전 정비공 · 강남역. 품계 정비공. 일하는 역 강남역."},"values":{"권위":40,"개방":-30,"무력":5,"물질":-20,"공동":45,"원칙":5,"공개":-50,"자격":45,"분산":-25,"변혁":20},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":30,"위험":5,"과시":-10,"지속":30,"지향":"무성향","결합":"다자"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0291","role":"single","personFaith":"baptised","houseFaith":"baptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"fitted","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0292', 'creative-b780-b3c4-bd09', '{"id":"person-0292","name":"Ran Jina","title":"Bench fitter","position":"Bench fitter · Gangnam Station","characterId":"K291","rank":"Fitter","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Implant maintenance","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0292","birthDate":"2067-10-25","birthday":"10-25","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"creative-b780-b3c4-bd09","name":"Ran Clan of Dobong","crest":"clan-crests/creative-b780-b3c4-bd09.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"Ran Jina lets no one out past the Gangnam threshold whose parts she has not opened once more before they leave. She has long been the one who checks the tools first among the packs of those going out to the border for a long time, so the young fitters call her the last hand at the door. In fifty-nine years she has received only one part, and that only after losing a place of her body to a frozen entrance frame. She has fed the bench meal to many households, so several people at Gangnam call her one pot.","fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Title":"Bench fitter","Rank":"Fitter","Livelihood":"Implant maintenance","Work Station":"Gangnam Station","Home Station":"Gangnam Station","Household":"Single household","Part Count":1},"sections":{"Life":"Ran Jina lets no one out past the Gangnam threshold whose parts she has not opened once more before they leave. She has long been the one who checks the tools first among the packs of those going out to the border for a long time, so the young fitters call her the last hand at the door. In fifty-nine years she has received only one part, and that only after losing a place of her body to a frozen entrance frame. She has fed the bench meal to many households, so several people at Gangnam call her one pot.","Offices":"Title Bench fitter. Position Bench fitter · Gangnam Station. Rank Fitter. Work station Gangnam Station."},"values":{"Authority":40,"Openness":-25,"Force":10,"Material":-25,"Communal":30,"Principle":5,"Public":-40,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":-15,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-25,"Display":25,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0292","role":"single","personFaith":"baptised","houseFaith":"baptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"fitted","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}', '{"id":"person-0292","name":"란진아","title":"정비공","position":"정비공 · 강남역","characterId":"K291","rank":"정비공","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"이식 정비","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"아크","detailRoute":"/people/person-0292","birthDate":"2067-10-25","birthday":"10-25","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"creative-b780-b3c4-bd09","name":"도봉 란씨","crest":"clan-crests/creative-b780-b3c4-bd09.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"란진아는 떠나기 전에 부위를 한 번 더 열어 보지 않은 사람을 강남역 문간 밖으로 내보내지 않는다. 오래 경계로 나가는 사람들의 짐 가운데 연장을 먼저 살피는 일을 맡아 와서, 젊은 정비공들은 그를 문간의 마지막 손이라 부른다. 쉰아홉 해를 살면서 부위는 하나만 받았고, 그것도 언 출입구 문틀에 몸 한 곳을 잃고서였다. 정비 밥을 떠 먹인 집안이 많아, 강남역에는 그를 한 솥이라 부르는 사람이 여럿이다.","fields":{"소속":"아크","직함":"정비공","품계":"정비공","생업":"이식 정비","일하는 역":"강남역","잠자는 역":"강남역","가구":"혼자 사는 가구","부위 수":1},"sections":{"생애":"란진아는 떠나기 전에 부위를 한 번 더 열어 보지 않은 사람을 강남역 문간 밖으로 내보내지 않는다. 오래 경계로 나가는 사람들의 짐 가운데 연장을 먼저 살피는 일을 맡아 와서, 젊은 정비공들은 그를 문간의 마지막 손이라 부른다. 쉰아홉 해를 살면서 부위는 하나만 받았고, 그것도 언 출입구 문틀에 몸 한 곳을 잃고서였다. 정비 밥을 떠 먹인 집안이 많아, 강남역에는 그를 한 솥이라 부르는 사람이 여럿이다.","관직":"직함 정비공. 직위 정비공 · 강남역. 품계 정비공. 일하는 역 강남역."},"values":{"권위":40,"개방":-25,"무력":10,"물질":-25,"공동":30,"원칙":5,"공개":-40,"자격":45,"분산":-15,"변혁":20},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":10,"위험":-25,"과시":25,"지속":-15,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0292","role":"single","personFaith":"baptised","houseFaith":"baptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"fitted","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0293', 'c12d-acbd-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0293","name":"Seop Chaewon","title":"Bench fitter","position":"Bench fitter · Banpo Station","characterId":"K292","rank":"Fitter","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Implant maintenance","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0293","birthDate":"2064-11-25","birthday":"11-25","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"c12d-acbd-c8fc","name":"Gyeongju Seop Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c12d-acbd-c8fc.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"Every time he opens a joint fitted by Free City hands, Seop Chaewon names the habits of those hands under his breath. When someone who crossed at the Gubanpo border shows a part fitted outside, it is he who first says at the Banpo bench whether it needs refitting, and the people of Banpo mostly follow his word. At sixty-two he rarely goes up to the surface, but with his two parts he still climbs to the Banpo entrance without a stick.","fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Title":"Bench fitter","Rank":"Fitter","Livelihood":"Implant maintenance","Work Station":"Banpo Station","Home Station":"Banpo Station","Household":"Single household","Part Count":2},"sections":{"Life":"Every time he opens a joint fitted by Free City hands, Seop Chaewon names the habits of those hands under his breath. When someone who crossed at the Gubanpo border shows a part fitted outside, it is he who first says at the Banpo bench whether it needs refitting, and the people of Banpo mostly follow his word. At sixty-two he rarely goes up to the surface, but with his two parts he still climbs to the Banpo entrance without a stick.","Offices":"Title Bench fitter. Position Bench fitter · Banpo Station. Rank Fitter. Work station Banpo Station."},"values":{"Authority":40,"Openness":-35,"Force":0,"Material":-30,"Communal":40,"Principle":0,"Public":-40,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":-20,"Transformative":25},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":35,"Display":30,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0293","role":"single","personFaith":"baptised","houseFaith":"baptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"fitted","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}', '{"id":"person-0293","name":"섭채원","title":"정비공","position":"정비공 · 반포역","characterId":"K292","rank":"정비공","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"이식 정비","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"아크","detailRoute":"/people/person-0293","birthDate":"2064-11-25","birthday":"11-25","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"c12d-acbd-c8fc","name":"경주 섭씨","crest":"clan-crests/c12d-acbd-c8fc.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"자유도시 쪽 손이 맞춘 이음매를 열 때마다, 섭채원은 그 손의 버릇을 혼잣말로 짚는다. 구반포 경계를 넘어온 사람이 밖에서 단 부위를 내보이면 반포역 정비대에서 다시 맞춤이 필요한지를 먼저 말하는 것이 그이고, 반포 사람들은 대개 그 말을 따른다. 예순둘이라 지상에는 거의 오르지 않지만, 부위 둘을 지닌 몸으로 반포역 출입구까지는 지팡이 없이 오른다.","fields":{"소속":"아크","직함":"정비공","품계":"정비공","생업":"이식 정비","일하는 역":"반포역","잠자는 역":"반포역","가구":"혼자 사는 가구","부위 수":2},"sections":{"생애":"자유도시 쪽 손이 맞춘 이음매를 열 때마다, 섭채원은 그 손의 버릇을 혼잣말로 짚는다. 구반포 경계를 넘어온 사람이 밖에서 단 부위를 내보이면 반포역 정비대에서 다시 맞춤이 필요한지를 먼저 말하는 것이 그이고, 반포 사람들은 대개 그 말을 따른다. 예순둘이라 지상에는 거의 오르지 않지만, 부위 둘을 지닌 몸으로 반포역 출입구까지는 지팡이 없이 오른다.","관직":"직함 정비공. 직위 정비공 · 반포역. 품계 정비공. 일하는 역 반포역."},"values":{"권위":40,"개방":-35,"무력":0,"물질":-30,"공동":40,"원칙":0,"공개":-40,"자격":30,"분산":-20,"변혁":25},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":30,"위험":35,"과시":30,"지속":40,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0293","role":"single","personFaith":"baptised","houseFaith":"baptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"fitted","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0294', 'd3c9-cda9-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0294","name":"Pyeong Chaewon","title":"Bench fitter","position":"Bench fitter · Gangnam Station","characterId":"K293","rank":"Fitter","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Implant maintenance","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0294","birthDate":"2080-10-12","birthday":"10-12","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"d3c9-cda9-c8fc","name":"Chungju Pyeong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d3c9-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"Moving the sleeping places of the ailing at Gangnam toward the bench wall is Pyeong Chaewon''s share every third shift. On fitting days she cleans joints, and at night she tells with her palm which walls are warm and which have cooled. In a winter some years ago when the water ran weak, she wrote down the water for each berth and sent it up to the Near House store, and thanks to that tally the ailing got water first that winter. The following year Pyeong Chaewon, just past forty, received her first part, and at forty-six she still carries that one.","fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Title":"Bench fitter","Rank":"Fitter","Livelihood":"Implant maintenance","Work Station":"Gangnam Station","Home Station":"Gangnam Station","Household":"Single household","Part Count":1},"sections":{"Life":"Moving the sleeping places of the ailing at Gangnam toward the bench wall is Pyeong Chaewon''s share every third shift. On fitting days she cleans joints, and at night she tells with her palm which walls are warm and which have cooled. In a winter some years ago when the water ran weak, she wrote down the water for each berth and sent it up to the Near House store, and thanks to that tally the ailing got water first that winter. The following year Pyeong Chaewon, just past forty, received her first part, and at forty-six she still carries that one.","Offices":"Title Bench fitter. Position Bench fitter · Gangnam Station. Rank Fitter. Work station Gangnam Station."},"values":{"Authority":40,"Openness":-25,"Force":5,"Material":-30,"Communal":50,"Principle":10,"Public":-50,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":-20,"Transformative":25},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-5,"Risk":10,"Display":20,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"None"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0294","role":"single","personFaith":"baptised","houseFaith":"baptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"fitted","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}', '{"id":"person-0294","name":"평채원","title":"정비공","position":"정비공 · 강남역","characterId":"K293","rank":"정비공","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"이식 정비","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"아크","detailRoute":"/people/person-0294","birthDate":"2080-10-12","birthday":"10-12","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"d3c9-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 평씨","crest":"clan-crests/d3c9-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"강남역 앓는 사람들의 잠자리를 정비대 벽 쪽으로 옮기는 일은 셋째 교대마다 평채원의 몫이다. 맞춤 날에는 이음매를 닦고, 밤에는 어느 벽이 따뜻하고 어느 벽이 식었는지 손바닥으로 가린다. 몇 해 전 물이 약하게 나오던 겨울, 그는 잠자리 칸마다 물 양을 적어 곁집 창고에 올렸고, 그 셈표 덕에 그 겨울 앓는 사람이 물을 먼저 받았다. 그 이듬해, 마흔을 갓 넘긴 평채원은 첫째 부위를 받았고 마흔여섯인 지금도 그 하나를 지닌다.","fields":{"소속":"아크","직함":"정비공","품계":"정비공","생업":"이식 정비","일하는 역":"강남역","잠자는 역":"강남역","가구":"혼자 사는 가구","부위 수":1},"sections":{"생애":"강남역 앓는 사람들의 잠자리를 정비대 벽 쪽으로 옮기는 일은 셋째 교대마다 평채원의 몫이다. 맞춤 날에는 이음매를 닦고, 밤에는 어느 벽이 따뜻하고 어느 벽이 식었는지 손바닥으로 가린다. 몇 해 전 물이 약하게 나오던 겨울, 그는 잠자리 칸마다 물 양을 적어 곁집 창고에 올렸고, 그 셈표 덕에 그 겨울 앓는 사람이 물을 먼저 받았다. 그 이듬해, 마흔을 갓 넘긴 평채원은 첫째 부위를 받았고 마흔여섯인 지금도 그 하나를 지닌다.","관직":"직함 정비공. 직위 정비공 · 강남역. 품계 정비공. 일하는 역 강남역."},"values":{"권위":40,"개방":-25,"무력":5,"물질":-30,"공동":50,"원칙":10,"공개":-50,"자격":25,"분산":-20,"변혁":25},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-5,"위험":10,"과시":20,"지속":-15,"지향":"유동","결합":"없음"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0294","role":"single","personFaith":"baptised","houseFaith":"baptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"fitted","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0295', 'b2e8-ac15-c74c', '{"id":"person-0295","name":"Dan Geonu","title":"Bench fitter","position":"Bench fitter · Garak Market Station","characterId":"K294","rank":"Fitter","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Implant maintenance","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0295","birthDate":"2086-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"b2e8-ac15-c74c","name":"Gangeum Dan Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b2e8-ac15-c74c.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"Dan Geonu''s notebook records, for every part opened at the Garak Market bench, the day it was opened and what was changed. It is a habit left over from his youth writing accident ledgers in a Free City workshop, still with him at forty. Outsiders who come to the Garak Market food exchange also buy maintenance turns at this bench, so the notebook holds the joints of Arc people and outsiders together. When turns are disputed, Bench Keeper Yeong Maon opens the notebook of this two-part fitter before the tally sheets.","fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Title":"Bench fitter","Rank":"Fitter","Livelihood":"Implant maintenance","Work Station":"Garak Market Station","Home Station":"Garak Market Station","Household":"Single household","Part Count":2},"sections":{"Life":"Dan Geonu''s notebook records, for every part opened at the Garak Market bench, the day it was opened and what was changed. It is a habit left over from his youth writing accident ledgers in a Free City workshop, still with him at forty. Outsiders who come to the Garak Market food exchange also buy maintenance turns at this bench, so the notebook holds the joints of Arc people and outsiders together. When turns are disputed, Bench Keeper Yeong Maon opens the notebook of this two-part fitter before the tally sheets.","Offices":"Title Bench 