rved the state dies, the burial permit passes through her seal. At April 19th National Cemetery station she checks the death-report ledger together with her house''s heir, Ra Jinu, and she never brings up, in any talk of token values, her debt to Mun Doyun, Governor of the Bank of Korea, who advanced fuel tokens for the burial processions.","Offices":"Title Member of the National Assembly for Gangbuk-gu. Position Member of the National Assembly for Gangbuk-gu · The Government. Rank Assembly Member. Work station April 19th National Cemetery Station."},"values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":-20,"Force":-35,"Material":-25,"Communal":25,"Principle":80,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":-35,"Transformative":-35},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":15,"Display":-30,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0326","role":"single","personFaith":"none","houseFaith":"none","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ra Seyeong","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Directly under President for Life Yun Seo-rin"},{"from":"Ra Seyeong","type":"Oath","to":"Ra Jinu","basis":"She checks the death-report ledger together with the heir of her house"},{"from":"Ra Seyeong","type":"Debt","to":"Mun Doyun","basis":"A debt to the Governor of the Bank of Korea for fuel tokens advanced for the burial processions"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bok Yong","type":"Command","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Directly under Member of the National Assembly for Gangbuk-gu Ra Seyeong"},{"from":"Gammo","type":"Command","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Directly under Member of the National Assembly for Gangbuk-gu Ra Seyeong"},{"from":"Ra Jinu","type":"Command","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Directly under Member of the National Assembly for Gangbuk-gu Ra Seyeong"},{"from":"Mun Baeun","type":"Command","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Directly under Member of the National Assembly for Gangbuk-gu Ra Seyeong"},{"from":"Ra Jinu","type":"Oath","to":"Ra Seye