","가구":"혼자 사는 가구","부위 수":1},"sections":{"생애":"첫 교대 부르기가 끝나고 맞춤 날 사람들이 줄을 서기 전, 선초별은 강남역 정비대 불을 하나씩 켜고 연장을 데운다. 스물다섯 해 사는 동안 받은 세례는 아직 하나라, 깃의 땀도 한 줄이다. 큰 정비대에서 순번이 밀린 사람을 돌려보내지 않으려고, 그는 셋째 교대에도 켜 둔 정비대 하나 곁에 남아 이음매를 닦는다. 매봉역 정비공 선한솜이 보성 선씨 집안 사람이라는 것을 그는 입에 올리지 않는다.","관직":"직함 정비공. 직위 정비공 · 강남역. 품계 정비공. 일하는 역 강남역."},"values":{"권위":0,"개방":25,"무력":-25,"물질":-20,"공동":35,"원칙":15,"공개":-25,"자격":-25,"분산":10,"변혁":60},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":5,"위험":-30,"과시":-10,"지속":35,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0406","role":"single","personFaith":"baptised","houseFaith":"baptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"fitted","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0407', 'c6d0-c6d0-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0407","name":"Won Saeul","title":"Bench Keeper of Sinnonhyeon","position":"Bench Keeper of Sinnonhyeon · Arc","characterId":"K406","rank":"Bench Keeper","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Leading a bench","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0407","birthDate":"2097-01-20","birthday":"01-20","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"c6d0-c6d0-c8fc","name":"Won Clan of Wonju","crest":"clan-crests/c6d0-c6d0-c8fc.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"Sinnonhyeon is a small station joined to Gangnam, so fitting-day people pushed out of the Gangnam bench come down to Won Saeul''s bench. At twenty-nine he already had four parts before he became Bench Keeper here, and he has shown in his own body the saying that one must have been opened before opening others. On days the share falls short, he first puts the number of people pushed his way before Seo Jin-a, Shelter Head of Seocho 4-dong.","fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Title":"Bench Keeper of Sinnonhyeon","Rank":"Bench Keeper","Livelihood":"Leading a bench","Work Station":"Sinnonhyeon Station","Home Station":"Sinnonhyeon Station","Household":"Single household","Part Count":4},"sections":{"Life":"Sinnonhyeon is a small station joined to Gangnam, so fitting-day people pushed out of the Gangnam bench come down to Won Saeul''s bench. At twenty-nine he already had four parts before he became Bench Keeper here, and he has shown in his own body the saying that one must have been opened before opening others. On days the share falls short, he first puts the number of people pushed his way before Seo Jin-a, Shelter Head of Seocho 4-dong.","Offices":"Title Bench Keeper of Sinnonhyeon. Position Bench Keeper of Sinnonhyeon · Arc. Rank Bench Keeper. Work station Sinnonhyeon Station."},"valu