 그때마다 자기 두 부위에 감은 토시를 풀어 남의 이음매부터 덮는다. 증인으로 설 때도 그는 연장 꾸러미를 내려놓지 않는다.","fields":{"소속":"아크","직함":"정비공","품계":"정비공","생업":"이식 정비","일하는 역":"경찰병원역","잠자는 역":"경찰병원역","가구":"혼자 사는 가구","부위 수":2},"sections":{"생애":"들은 대로만 말한다는 평판 하나로, 탁세온은 경찰병원역에서 정비 차례 다툼이 날 때마다 불려 나간다. 올해 서른둘인 그가 한때 계약 자리에서 증인으로 선 적이 있어서다. 정비공으로서 그의 하루는 대부분 지상에서 일하다 부위가 언 사람을 맞는 데 들고, 그때마다 자기 두 부위에 감은 토시를 풀어 남의 이음매부터 덮는다. 증인으로 설 때도 그는 연장 꾸러미를 내려놓지 않는다.","관직":"직함 정비공. 직위 정비공 · 경찰병원역. 품계 정비공. 일하는 역 경찰병원역."},"values":{"권위":5,"개방":15,"무력":-10,"물질":-40,"공동":35,"원칙":10,"공개":-25,"자격":-10,"분산":5,"변혁":65},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":30,"위험":35,"과시":0,"지속":25,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0419","role":"single","personFaith":"baptised","houseFaith":"baptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"fitted","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":"machine"},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0420', 'bc94-ae08-c131', '{"id":"person-0420","name":"Beom Hagyeom","title":"Bench fitter","position":"Bench fitter · Gaerong Station","characterId":"K419","rank":"Fitter","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Implant maintenance","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0420","birthDate":"2091-03-11","birthday":"03-11","age":35,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"bc94-ae08-c131","name":"Geumseong Beom Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc94-ae08-c131.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"The bench-meal pot at Gaerong is kept by Beom Hagyeom. Because he remembers which fitters'' household fed whom first that day, quarrels between those of one pot end with him at Gaerong. He takes his own meal only after the pot is empty, and in thirty-five years, it is said, he did not change that order even while he lay sick after receiving his single part.","fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Title":"Bench fitter","Rank":"Fitter","Livelihood":"Implant maintenance","Work Station":"Gaerong Station","Home Station":"Gaerong Station","Household":"Single household","Part Count":1},"sections":{"Life":"The bench-meal pot at Gaerong is kept by Beom Hagyeom. Because he remembers which fitters'' household fed whom first that day, quarrels between those of one pot end with him at Gaerong. He takes his own meal only after the pot is empty, and in thirty-five years, it is said, he did not change that order even while he lay sick after receiving his single part.","Offices":"Title Bench fitter. Position Bench fitter · Gaerong Station. Rank Fitter. Work station Gaerong Station."},"values":{"Authority":-5,"Openness":15,"Force":-10,"Material":-45,"Communal":30,"Principle":45,"Public":0,"Eligibility":-10,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":55},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":35,"Display":-20,"Sustained":30,"O