"생업":"교육","일하는 역":"이태원역","잠자는 역":"이태원역","가구":"혼자 사는 가구"},"sections":{"생애":"이태원역 깊은 층의 용산구 의원 집안 잠자리 칸에 밀양 박씨 박은윤, 열다섯 살이 아이로 올라 있다. 박태겸 의원 집안의 창고에서 끼니를 받고, 무명 안감 외투를 입은 채 지상에는 거의 나가지 않는다. 오전에는 집안의 어린 아이들과 함께 한글과 장부 셈을 배우고, 오후에는 집안 사람들을 따라 이태원 펌프실에 내려가 닳은 축을 버리지 않고 깎아 다시 끼우는 법을 어깨너머로 본다.","관직":"직함 배우는 아이. 직위 배우는 아이 · 이태원역. 품계 등재민. 일하는 역 이태원역."},"values":{"권위":40,"개방":-30,"무력":10,"물질":0,"공동":20,"원칙":50,"공개":-15,"자격":30,"분산":-40,"변혁":-30},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0465","role":"single","personFaith":"none","houseFaith":"none","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"박은윤","type":"지휘","to":"박태겸","basis":"용산구 국회의원 박태겸의 직속"}],"incoming":[]},"directLiege":{"personId":"K169","name":"박태겸","courtId":"court:K169","effectiveYear":2126,"ownerTerm":"직속 주군","relationKind":"direct-liege"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0466', 'cd5c-ac15-b989-5d14', '{"id":"person-0466","name":"Choe Jihun","title":"Baptised fighter","position":"Baptised fighter · Irwon Station","rank":"Baptised","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Baptised fighting","gender":"Male","stage":"S4","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0466","birthDate":"2082-11-15","birthday":"11-15","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"Irwon is the southern end of Gangnam, so fighting is rare, and the shifts of forty-four-year-old baptised fighter Choe Jihun mostly end with checking the surface paths toward Daemosan. He stitched the three part-count lines on his right collar with his own hands. Whenever he is called to the north tunnel, he takes his fitting at the Irwon bench before he leaves.","fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Title":"Baptised fighter","Rank":"Baptised","Livelihood":"Baptised fighting","Work Station":"Irwon Station","Home Station":"Irwon Station","Household":"Single household","Part Count":3},"sections":{"Life":"Irwon is the southern end of Gangnam, so fighting is rare, and the shifts of forty-four-year-old baptised fighter Choe Jihun mostly end with checking the surface paths toward Daemosan. He stitched the three part-count lines on his right collar with his own hands. Whenever he is called to the north tunnel, he takes his fitting at the Irwon bench before he leaves.","Offices":"Title Baptised fighter. Position Baptised fighter · Irwon Station. Rank Baptised. Work station Irwon Station."},"values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":-10,"Force":15,"Material":-30,"Communal":40,"Principle":10,"Public":-40,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":-20,"Transformative":40},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0466","role":"single","personFaith":"baptised","houseFaith":"baptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abili