 안씨 집안의 몫으로 나선 쉰세 살의 가문 징집병이다. 평소에는 신반포 대피소의 출입구 당번을 서고, 부름이 오면 고속터미널 쪽으로 이어진 터널을 따라 모이는 줄에 선다. 부위는 없고, 정비대 앞에 선 날보다 출입구 앞에 선 날이 훨씬 많다.","관직":"직함 가문 징집병. 직위 가문 징집병 · 신반포역. 품계 미세례자. 일하는 역 신반포역."},"values":{"권위":0,"개방":5,"무력":-25,"물질":-50,"공동":35,"원칙":30,"공개":-15,"자격":-20,"분산":15,"변혁":50},"desire":{"갈망":20,"독점":30,"위험":30,"과시":-30,"지속":-20,"지향":"무성향","결합":"비독점"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0599","role":"single","personFaith":"unbaptised","houseFaith":"unbaptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":4,"effective":4},"intrigue":{"base":5,"effective":5},"learning":{"base":4,"effective":4},"prowess":{"base":10,"effective":10}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0600', 'c1a1-c740-c9c4-5b8b', '{"id":"person-0600","name":"Song Haji","title":"Intake keeper","position":"Intake keeper · Yeongdeungpo Station","characterId":"K600","rank":"Apprentice","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Intake maintenance","gender":"Male","stage":"S4","state":"free-city","stateName":"The Free Cities","detailRoute":"/people/person-0600","birthDate":"2073-02-13","birthday":"02-13","age":53,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"c1a1-c740-c9c4-5b8b","name":"Eunjin Song Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c1a1-c740-c9c4-5b8b.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"Song Haji is a man who became an apprentice of the intake bench at fifty-three. For a long time he was a labourer carrying water drums in the Yeongdeungpo market; he earned wages beside the hands who keep the Yangpyeong-dong intake until that bench''s owner let him join as an apprentice. Wearing only the same coloured cord as the children, he is learning how to break the ice in the intake pipes. In the third water contract he wants to add one pair of hands to the work of pushing the intake out towards the deep channel.","fields":{"Affiliation":"The Free Cities","Title":"Intake keeper","Rank":"Apprentice","Livelihood":"Intake maintenance","Work Station":"Yeongdeungpo Station","Home Station":"Yeongdeungpo Station","Household":"Single household"},"sections":{"Life":"Song Haji is a man who became an apprentice of the intake bench at fifty-three. For a long time he was a labourer carrying water drums in the Yeongdeungpo market; he earned wages beside the hands who keep the Yangpyeong-dong intake until that bench''s owner let him join as an apprentice. Wearing only the same coloured cord as the children, he is learning how to break the ice in the intake pipes. In the third water contract he wants to add one pair of hands to the work of pushing the intake out towards the deep channel.","Offices":"Title Intake keeper. Position Intake keeper · Yeongdeungpo Station. Rank Apprentice. Work station Yeongdeungpo Station."},"values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":15,"Force":5,"Material":45,"Communal":5,"Principle":20,"Public":0,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-15,"Display":15,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"None"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0600","role":"single","personFaith":"none","houseFaith":"none","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}', '{"id":"person-0600","name":"송하지","title":"취수구지기","position":"취수구지기 · 영등포역","characterId":"K600","rank":"견습","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"취수구 정비","gender":"남성","stage":"S4","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시들","detailRoute":"/people/person-0600","birthDate":"2073-02-13","birthday":"02-13","age":53,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"c1a1-c740-c9c4-5b8b","name":"은진 송씨","crest":"clan-crests/c1a1-c740-c9c4-5b8b.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"송하지는 쉰세 살에 취수구대의 견습이 된 사람이다. 오랫동안 영등포 장터에서 물통을 나르는 일손이었고, 양평동 취수구를 손보는 손들 곁에서 품삯을 받다가 그 대 대주의 허락을 얻어 견습으로 붙었다. 그는 아이들과 같은 빛깔 끈만 단 채 취수구 관의 얼음을 깨는 법을 배운다. 세 번째 급수계약에서 취수구를 깊은 물길 쪽으로 내미는 일에 그는 손 하나를 보태고 싶어 한다.","fields":{"소속":"자유도시들","직함":"취수구지기","품계":"견습","생업":"취수구 정비","일하는 역":"영등포역","잠자는 역":"영등포역","가구":"혼자 사는 가구"},"sections":{"생애":"송하지는 쉰세 살에 취수구대의 견습이 된 사람이다. 오랫동안 영등포 장터에서 물통을 나르는 일손이었고, 양평동 취수구를 손보는 손들 곁에서 품삯을 받다가 그 대 대주의 허락을 얻어 견습으로 붙었다. 그는 아이들과 같은 빛깔 끈만 단 채 취수구 관의 얼음을 깨는 법을 배운다. 세 번째 급수계약에서 취수구를 깊은 물길 쪽으로 내미는 일에 그는 손 하나를 보태고 싶어 한다.","관직":"직함 취수구지기. 직위 취수구지기 · 영등포역. 품계 견습. 일하는 역 영등포역."},"values":{"권위":15,"개방":15,"무력":5,"물질":45,"공동":5,"원칙":20,"공개":0,"자격":25,"분산":15,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-20,"위험":-15,"과시":15,"지속":-10,"지향":"동성","결합":"없음"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0600","role":"single","personFaith":"none","houseFaith":"none","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0601', 'b958-bb38-d654-67f3', '{"id":"person-0601","name":"Ryu Dongyeon","title":"Vehicle fitter","position":"Vehicle fitter · Sinmokdong Station","rank":"Hand","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Vehicle maintenance","gender":"Male","stage":"S4","state":"free-city","stateName":"The Free Cities","detailRoute":"/people/person-0601","birthDate":"2080-02-08","birthday":"02-08","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"Ryu Dongyeon is counted the best hand in Yangcheon at rewinding motors. At a bench in Sinmokdong Station he unwinds the copper wire of motors taken from old trains and winds it again, scratching his own mark into every motor he finishes. Motors bearing that mark sell above the tally-board price in the Yeongdeungpo market. The first mark he ever scratched is still on a motor that runs.","fields":{"Affiliation":"The Free Cities","Title":"Vehicle fitter","Rank":"Hand","Livelihood":"Vehicle maintenance","Work Station":"Sinmokdong Station","Home Station":"Sinmokdong Station","Household":"Single household"},"sections":{"Life":"Ryu Dongyeon is counted the best hand in Yangcheon at rewinding motors. At a bench in Sinmokdong Station he unwinds the copper wire of motors taken from old trains and winds it again, scratching his own mark into every motor he finishes. Motors bearing that mark sell above the tally-board price in the Yeongdeungpo market. The first mark he ever scratched is still on a motor that runs.","Offices":"Title Vehicle fitter. Position Vehicle fitter · Sinmokdong Station. Rank Hand. Work station Sinmokdong Station."},"values":{"Authority":-30,"Openness":20,"Force":-20,"Material":40,"Communal":0,"Principle":10,"Public":30,"Eligibility":50,"Dispersed":50,"Transformative":10},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0601","role":"single","personFaith":"none","houseFaith":"none","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relatio