저 닳는지 안다. 펌프 하나가 멎으면 그는 고칠 손을 부르러 가기 전에 그 앞에 먼저 귀를 댄다.","관직":"직함 열 펌프지기. 직위 열 펌프지기 · 석촌역. 품계 미세례자. 일하는 역 석촌역."},"values":{"권위":30,"개방":-10,"무력":0,"물질":-30,"공동":40,"원칙":10,"공개":-40,"자격":10,"분산":-20,"변혁":40},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0730","role":"single","personFaith":"unbaptised","houseFaith":"unbaptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0731', 'b178-c7a5-c5f0-76e7', '{"id":"person-0731","name":"No Baa","title":"Heat-pump keeper","position":"Heat-pump keeper · Yangjae Citizen''s Forest Station","characterId":"K731","rank":"Unbaptised","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Heat-pump maintenance","gender":"Female","stage":"S4","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0731","birthDate":"2097-07-25","birthday":"07-25","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"b178-c7a5-c5f0-76e7","name":"Jangyeon No Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b178-c7a5-c5f0-76e7.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"The heat pump at Yangjae Citizen''s Forest station is the oldest at the southern end of Seocho, so twenty-nine-year-old No Baa spends half of each day lying under it. She keeps a worn drawing left by a repairer who came over from the Free City pasted inside the pump cover, and in months when no replacement fitting arrives she looks at it and makes do with what there is. Like Seocho people, she talks to her workmates without ceremony and makes her promises in numbers. She says that when the day comes to unpick the sewn-shut maintenance gaps in her coat, she will unpick them in front of the pump.","fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Title":"Heat-pump keeper","Rank":"Unbaptised","Livelihood":"Heat-pump maintenance","Work Station":"Yangjae Citizen''s Forest Station","Home Station":"Yangjae Citizen''s Forest Station","Household":"Single household","Part Count":0},"sections":{"Life":"The heat pump at Yangjae Citizen''s Forest station is the oldest at the southern end of Seocho, so twenty-nine-year-old No Baa spends half of each day lying under it. She keeps a worn drawing left by a repairer who came over from the Free City pasted inside the pump cover, and in months when no replacement fitting arrives she looks at it and makes do with what there is. Like Seocho people, she talks to her workmates without ceremony and makes her promises in numbers. She says that when the day comes to unpick the sewn-shut maintenance gaps in her coat, she will unpick them in front of the pump.","Offices":"Title Heat-pump keeper. Position Heat-pump keeper · Yangjae Citizen''s Forest Station. Rank Unbaptised. Work station Yangjae Citizen''s Forest Station."},"values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":5,"Force":-10,"Material":-40,"Communal":60,"Principle":10,"Public":-60,"Eligibility":-15,"Dispersed":0,"Transformative":45},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":5,"Display":5,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0731","role":"single","personFaith":"unbaptised","houseFaith":"unbaptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}', '{"id":"person-0731","name":"노바아","title":"열 펌프지기","position":"열 펌프지기 · 양재시민의숲역","characterId":"K731","rank":"미세례자","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"열 펌프 정비","gender":"여성","stage":"S4","state":"arc","stateName":"아크","detailRoute":"/people/person-0731","birthDate":"2097-07-25","birthday":"07-25","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","generation":"opening","clan":{"id":"b178-c7a5-c5f0-76e7","name":"장연 노씨","crest":"clan-crests/b178-c7a5-c5f0-76e7.svg"},"sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"양재시민의숲역의 열 펌프는 서초 남쪽 끝에서 가장 오래된 것이라, 스물아홉 살 노바아는 하루의 절반을 그 밑에 엎드려 보낸다. 자유도시에서 넘어온 수리공이 남긴 낡은 그림 한 장을 펌프 덮개 안쪽에 붙여 두고, 바꿀 부속이 오지 않는 달에는 그 그림을 보며 있는 것으로 맞춘다. 서초 사람답게 그녀도 동료에게 반말을 하고 약속은 숫자로 한다. 겉옷에 꿰매 둔 정비 틈 자리를 뜯는 날이 오면 펌프 앞에서 뜯겠다고 그녀는 말한다.","fields":{"소속":"아크","직함":"열 펌프지기","품계":"미세례자","생업":"열 펌프 정비","일하는 역":"양재시민의숲역","잠자는 역":"양재시민의숲역","가구":"혼자 사는 가구","부위 수":0},"sections":{"생애":"양재시민의숲역의 열 펌프는 서초 남쪽 끝에서 가장 오래된 것이라, 스물아홉 살 노바아는 하루의 절반을 그 밑에 엎드려 보낸다. 자유도시에서 넘어온 수리공이 남긴 낡은 그림 한 장을 펌프 덮개 안쪽에 붙여 두고, 바꿀 부속이 오지 않는 달에는 그 그림을 보며 있는 것으로 맞춘다. 서초 사람답게 그녀도 동료에게 반말을 하고 약속은 숫자로 한다. 겉옷에 꿰매 둔 정비 틈 자리를 뜯는 날이 오면 펌프 앞에서 뜯겠다고 그녀는 말한다.","관직":"직함 열 펌프지기. 직위 열 펌프지기 · 양재시민의숲역. 품계 미세례자. 일하는 역 양재시민의숲역."},"values":{"권위":20,"개방":5,"무력":-10,"물질":-40,"공동":60,"원칙":10,"공개":-60,"자격":-15,"분산":0,"변혁":45},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":40,"위험":5,"과시":5,"지속":5,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0731","role":"single","personFaith":"unbaptised","houseFaith":"unbaptised","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0732', 'd558-c9c4-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0732","name":"Ha Jaeun","title":"Heat-pump keeper","position":"Heat-pump keeper · Seokchon Gobun Station","rank":"Baptised","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Heat-pump maintenance","gender":"Female","stage":"S4","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","detailRoute":"/people/person-0732","birthDate":"2068-01-01","birthday":"01-01","age":58,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"Ha Jaeun''s first shift begins with her palm laid against the wall where the pipes of the Seokchon Gobun heat pump run. She received her first part at fifty-eight, and she laughs at herself that her voice still shakes a little when she answers \"Ha Jaeun, who received the first part\" at the calling. Young unbaptised workers who come to learn the pump must memorise from her the order for closing the pipes before the order for opening them. When a fitting day draws near, she picks out the person to leave the pump with two days ahead.","fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Title":"Heat-pump keeper","Rank":"Baptised","Livelihood":"Heat-pump maintenance","Work Station":"Seokchon Gobun Station","Home Station":"Seokchon Gobun Station","Household":"Single household","Part Count":1},"sections":{"Life":"Ha Jaeun''s first shift begins with her palm laid against the wall where the pipes of the Seokchon Gobun heat pump run. She received her first part at fifty-eight, and she laughs at herself that her voice still shakes a little when she answers \"Ha Jaeun, who received the first part\" at the calling. Young unbaptised workers who come to learn the pump must memorise from her the order for closing the pipes before the order for opening them. When a fitting day draws near, she picks out the person to leave the pump with two days ahead.","Offices":"Title Heat-pump keeper. Position Heat-pump keeper · Seokchon Gobun Station. Rank Baptised. 