"영등포역","가구":"혼자 사는 가구"},"sections":{"생애":"고늘진은 영등포역 장터에 판 하나를 가진 집안의 서른 살 사람이다. 그의 집안은 구로에서 오는 부품과 관악의 땔감을 받아 강서와 양천의 작업대로 넘기는 판을 오래 지켜 왔다. 아침 셈판이 붙으면 그는 그날 값을 보기 전에 지난 열흘 값의 흐름부터 판 옆 벽에 옮겨 적는다. 값이 오르는 날에도 하루에 넘길 몫을 미리 정해 두고, 그 이상은 팔지 않는다.","관직":"직함 장터 집안 사람. 직위 장터 집안 사람 · 영등포역. 품계 손. 일하는 역 영등포역."},"values":{"권위":5,"개방":10,"무력":10,"물질":75,"공동":5,"원칙":10,"공개":15,"자격":10,"분산":10,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":40,"위험":-10,"과시":25,"지속":35,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0760","role":"single","personFaith":"none","houseFaith":"none","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":4,"effective":4},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0761', 'bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587', '{"id":"person-0761","name":"Mun Dal-eun","title":"Market trader","position":"Market trader · Daerim Station","rank":"Hand","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Market trading","gender":"Female","stage":"S4","state":"free-city","stateName":"The Free Cities","detailRoute":"/people/person-0761","birthDate":"2093-06-08","birthday":"06-08","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"The stall Mun Dal-eun''s family has kept on the Daerim Station platform stands where Lines 2 and 7 cross. She is thirty-three, and she takes the pump vanes and bearings that Guro''s benches machine and passes them on to people from Geumcheon and Dongjak who come by Line 7. Each time she hands over a vane she writes the name of the bench it came from on the sheet, so that a faulty blade can go straight back to that bench.","fields":{"Affiliation":"The Free Cities","Title":"Market trader","Rank":"Hand","Livelihood":"Market trading","Work Station":"Daerim Station","Home Station":"Daerim Station","Household":"Single household"},"sections":{"Life":"The stall Mun Dal-eun''s family has kept on the Daerim Station platform stands where Lines 2 and 7 cross. She is thirty-three, and she takes the pump vanes and bearings that Guro''s benches machine and passes them on to people from Geumcheon and Dongjak who come by Line 7. Each time she hands over a vane she writes the name of the bench it came from on the sheet, so that a faulty blade can go straight back to that bench.","Offices":"Title Market trader. Position Market trader · Daerim Station. Rank Hand. Work station Daerim Station."},"values":{"Authority":-30,"Openness":25,"Force":-20,"Material":50,"Communal":0,"Principle":10,"Public":30,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":50,"Transformative":10},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0761","role":"single","personFaith":"none","houseFaith":"none","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":4,"effective":4},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}}}', '{"id":"person-0761","name":"문달은","title":"장터 집안 사람","position":"장터 집안 사람 · 대림역","rank":"손","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"장터 거래","gender":"여성","stage":"S4","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시들","detailRoute":"/people/person-0761","birthDate":"2093-06-08","birthday":"06-08","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"대림역 승강장에서 문달은의 집안이 지켜 온 판은 2호선과 7호선이 엇갈리는 자리에 있다. 그는 서른셋이고, 구로 작업대가 깎은 펌프 날개와 베어링을 받아, 7호선을 타고 오는 금천과 동작 사람에게 넘긴다. 날개 하나를 넘길 때마다 그는 어느 대의 것인지 대 이름을 장에 적어, 날이 상하면 그 대로 바로 돌려보낼 수 있게 한다.","fields":{"소속":"자유도시들","직함":"장터 집안 사람","품계":"손","생업":"장터 거래","일하는 역":"대림역","잠자는 역":"대림역","가구":"혼자 사는 가구"},"sections":{"생애":"대림역 승강장에서 문달은의 집안이 지켜 온 판은 2호선과 7호선이 엇갈리는 자리에 있다. 그는 서른셋이고, 구로 작업대가 깎은 펌프 날개와 베어링을 받아, 7호선을 타고 오는 금천과 동작 사람에게 넘긴다. 날개 하나를 넘길 때마다 그는 어느 대의 것인지 대 이름을 장에 적어, 날이 상하면 그 대로 바로 돌려보낼 수 있게 한다.","관직":"직함 장터 집안 사람. 직위 장터 집안 사람 · 대림역. 품계 손. 일하는 역 대림역."},"values":{"권위":-30,"개방":25,"무력":-20,"물질":50,"공동":0,"원칙":10,"공개":30,"자격":40,"분산":50,"변혁":10},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0761","role":"single","personFaith":"none","houseFaith":"none","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":