 세대가 많은 큰 역이라 그의 기재 창구에는 출생 신고와 전입 서류가 날마다 쌓이고, 문화 류씨 공무원 가구에서 자란 그는 어릴 때부터 그런 서류 더미 곁에서 셈을 배웠다. 장부가 틀리면 서기의 책임이어서, 그는 도장을 찍기 전에 사본 칸을 두 번 읽는다.","관직":"직함 동주민센터 서기. 직위 동주민센터 서기 · 서울역. 품계 주사. 일하는 역 서울역."},"values":{"권위":70,"개방":-60,"무력":10,"물질":-30,"공동":15,"원칙":95,"공개":-30,"자격":15,"분산":-90,"변혁":-55},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":30,"위험":25,"과시":-15,"지속":35,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"household":{"id":"hh:person-0797","role":"single","personFaith":"none","houseFaith":"none","humanoidAdmission":"none"},"relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[],"traits":[],"health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[]}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0798', NULL, '{"id":"person-0798","name":"Emma King","title":"Market trader","position":"Market trader · Meokgol Station","rank":"Registered resident","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Market trading","gender":"Female","stage":"S4","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","detailRoute":"/people/person-0798","birthDate":"2082-07-15","birthday":"07-15","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","sourceKind":"proposal","minors":false,"biography":"In the Meokgol Station register of traders, Emma''s goods are entered as needles and thread. She brings needles and skeins in bundles from the Sangbong market, splits them into single pieces at her place on the Meokgol platform, and sells them at her Sangbong stall on market days. She says needles hold their value and are more trustworthy than tokens, and her accounts are in fact kept in needles, not tokens. People at Meokgol call her the needle house instead of her name.","fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Title":"Market trader","Rank":"Registered resident","Livelihood":"Market trading","Work Station":"Meokgol Station","Home Station":"Meokgol Station","Household":"Single household"},"sections":{"Life":"In the Meokgol Station register of traders, Emma''s goods are entered as needles and thread. She brings needles and skeins in bundles from the Sangbong market, splits them into single pieces at her place on the Meokgol platform, and sells them at her Sangbong stall on market days. She says needles hold their value and are more trustworthy than tokens, and her accounts are in fact kept in needles, not tokens. People at Meokgol call her the needle house instead of her name.","Offices":"Title Market trader. Position Market trader · Meokgol Station. Rank Registered resident. Work station Meokgol Station."},"values":{"Authority":40,"Openness":-25,"Force":10,"Material":10,"Communal":20,"Principle":40,"Public":-20,"Eligi